{"3776880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ELEMENTAL SOUL", "steam_appid": 3776880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from the void, you feel drawn to something beyond an old dungeon.<br>Use the power to wield light and elements to defeat colourful enemies, recover the light and powerful relics, help rebuild the village, grow stronger and challenge your enemies again. Explore this world full of secrets and reach the origin to illuminate everything with the light of truth. <strong>Relentlessly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/0d081f7028b7da02a50ffb624aa3daa6.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/0d081f7028b7da02a50ffb624aa3daa6.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/0d081f7028b7da02a50ffb624aa3daa6.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5ec0253ece78eba09d29a01ca4e1a4a7.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5ec0253ece78eba09d29a01ca4e1a4a7.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5ec0253ece78eba09d29a01ca4e1a4a7.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Elemental Soul there are three main elements — <strong>fire, plant and water</strong> — and the player can wield that mysterious <strong>power</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right element will give you an edge in battle against enemies. Choose the wrong one... and good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But what happens if the elements collide at just the right moment?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/e65fa512eb1fc1cf52b7567922fa1ef2.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/e65fa512eb1fc1cf52b7567922fa1ef2.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/e65fa512eb1fc1cf52b7567922fa1ef2.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How many relics above are showing their abilities?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In treasure chests you discover on your journey, you'll find hundreds of <strong>weapons and relics</strong> with unique abilities. You can carry up to three weapons at a time, and you can absorb relics endlessly and grow stronger.  <br>Discover various synergies and create the optimal build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/99d75a9b94331f0a898cfc17e22b539c.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/99d75a9b94331f0a898cfc17e22b539c.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/99d75a9b94331f0a898cfc17e22b539c.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While on your adventure you make <strong>choices</strong> to determine your own path. Your decisions affect the stages, the story that follows, the bosses you face and the village NPCs — the entire world. An action you didn't expect could later bring a huge change!  <br>So it doesn't hurt to take your time and explore the <strong>secrets and hidden stories</strong> scattered everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, the <strong>growing village</strong> will make you stronger or provide useful assistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/647bf8671614c85358d4ed1a89218148.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/647bf8671614c85358d4ed1a89218148.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/647bf8671614c85358d4ed1a89218148.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you defeat a chapter <strong>boss</strong>, you can proceed to the next story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/711d983203cbcb14dc73aaccdbd08272.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/711d983203cbcb14dc73aaccdbd08272.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/711d983203cbcb14dc73aaccdbd08272.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So venture into this dangerous new world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refined 2D pixel‑art platformer roguelite RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental action combat with a hint of soulslike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapons and relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from the void, you feel drawn to something beyond an old dungeon.<br>Use the power to wield light and elements to defeat colourful enemies, recover the light and powerful relics, help rebuild the village, grow stronger and challenge your enemies again. Explore this world full of secrets and reach the origin to illuminate everything with the light of truth. <strong>Relentlessly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/0d081f7028b7da02a50ffb624aa3daa6.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/0d081f7028b7da02a50ffb624aa3daa6.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/0d081f7028b7da02a50ffb624aa3daa6.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5ec0253ece78eba09d29a01ca4e1a4a7.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5ec0253ece78eba09d29a01ca4e1a4a7.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5ec0253ece78eba09d29a01ca4e1a4a7.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Elemental Soul there are three main elements — <strong>fire, plant and water</strong> — and the player can wield that mysterious <strong>power</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right element will give you an edge in battle against enemies. Choose the wrong one... and good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But what happens if the elements collide at just the right moment?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/e65fa512eb1fc1cf52b7567922fa1ef2.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/e65fa512eb1fc1cf52b7567922fa1ef2.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/e65fa512eb1fc1cf52b7567922fa1ef2.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How many relics above are showing their abilities?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In treasure chests you discover on your journey, you'll find hundreds of <strong>weapons and relics</strong> with unique abilities. You can carry up to three weapons at a time, and you can absorb relics endlessly and grow stronger.  <br>Discover various synergies and create the optimal build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/99d75a9b94331f0a898cfc17e22b539c.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/99d75a9b94331f0a898cfc17e22b539c.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/99d75a9b94331f0a898cfc17e22b539c.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While on your adventure you make <strong>choices</strong> to determine your own path. Your decisions affect the stages, the story that follows, the bosses you face and the village NPCs — the entire world. An action you didn't expect could later bring a huge change!  <br>So it doesn't hurt to take your time and explore the <strong>secrets and hidden stories</strong> scattered everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, the <strong>growing village</strong> will make you stronger or provide useful assistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/647bf8671614c85358d4ed1a89218148.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/647bf8671614c85358d4ed1a89218148.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/647bf8671614c85358d4ed1a89218148.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you defeat a chapter <strong>boss</strong>, you can proceed to the next story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/711d983203cbcb14dc73aaccdbd08272.poster.avif?t=1775448670\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/711d983203cbcb14dc73aaccdbd08272.webm?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/711d983203cbcb14dc73aaccdbd08272.mp4?t=1775448670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So venture into this dangerous new world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refined 2D pixel‑art platformer roguelite RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental action combat with a hint of soulslike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapons and relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Challenge the increasingly intense light as you approach! Defeat enemies with elemental powers, absorb items, and grow until you reach the end.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Greek, Dutch, Norwegian, Danish, Russian, Romanian, Vietnamese, Bulgarian, Swedish, Spanish - Latin America, Arabic, Ukrainian, Indonesian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Czech, Thai, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish, Finnish, Hungarian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass